<title>USA: Tenet Healthcare Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Tenet Healthcare Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>SANTA BARBARA, Calif, Jan 9 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			 Nov 30, 1996		Nov 30, 1995</p>
<p> Shr		  $    0.35	     $     0.85</p>
<p> Net			  76.8		   182.8</p>
<p> Revs		     1,476.1		1,370.9</p>
<p>	  Six MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $	0.68	    $	1.41</p>
<p> Net			 149.2		   301.1</p>
<p> Revs		   2,914.7		  2,654.8</p>
<p>(All data above millions except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 q2 and six months per share figures include gains of $0.54 and $0.82, respectively, from sale of facilities.</p>
<p>For the second fiscal quarter, EBITDA of $291,727,000 in the November 1996 quarter increased 6.6 percent from $273,770,000 in the prior-year period.  EBITDA margins were 19.8 percent, compared with 20 percent in the prior-year period.  Operating margins were 14 percent in both years.</p>
</text>
